+ *  6 splash_speedT u16  8 reset_rx  9 ble_security  10 ble_devname[20]
+ * 30 year u16  32 mon  33 day  34 hour  35 min  36 sec
+ * 37 batt raw u16  39 batt mV u16  41 charging  42 mode
